{"id":"n63247-1-8","stage":3,"title":"설문지 · 问卷","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n63247-1-8-1","ko":"괜찮으시다면 이 설문지 한 장만 써 주실 수 있을까요?","zh":"如果方便，能帮忙填一下这张问卷吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"괜찮으시다면","meaning":"没关系，无所谓，可以","explanation":"괜찮다：没关系，无所谓，可以；으시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体；다면：假定某情况成立：“如果、假如……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"괜찮다","audio":"/audio/b9a2699f824000e36e45.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60097","senseId":"3","lemma":"괜찮다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"괜찮으시다면","audio":"/audio/91306d5245166ef4f17a.mp3"}},{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"설문지","meaning":"问卷，调查问卷","explanation":"설문지：问卷，调查问卷。","readings":[{"term":"설문지","audio":"/audio/4c391048d251fb39da86.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63247","senseId":"1","lemma":"설문지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"설문지","audio":"/audio/4c391048d251fb39da86.mp3"}},{"text":"한","meaning":"一个","explanation":"한：一个。","readings":[{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73278","senseId":"2","lemma":"한","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}},{"text":"장만","meaning":"张，枚，纸","explanation":"장：张，枚，纸；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"장","audio":"/audio/2dfdb434387c361c95cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29607","senseId":"1","lemma":"장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"장만","audio":"/audio/ce48518c2dc1c993ee8b.mp3"}},{"text":"써","meaning":"写，填写","explanation":"쓰다：写，填写；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"쓰다","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65172","senseId":"3","lemma":"쓰다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"써","audio":"/audio/a56108d30e19595a1562.mp3"}},{"text":"주실","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주실","audio":"/audio/00ef51f0814b98d6d743.mp3"}},{"text":"수","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能。","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}},{"text":"있을까요?","meaning":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","explanation":"있다：能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）；을까요：礼貌地询问意见、提出建议或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"5","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있을까요","audio":"/audio/ef6f1745d773e6085ac3.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"b9a2699f824000e3","term":"괜찮다","zh":"没关系，无所谓，可以","audio":"/audio/b9a2699f824000e36e45.mp3","entryId":"60097","definition":"不用担心或没有问题，可以允许。","pronunciation":["괜찬타"]},{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"4c391048d251fb39","term":"설문지","zh":"问卷，调查问卷","audio":"/audio/4c391048d251fb39da86.mp3","entryId":"63247","definition":"以调查为目的，记载向人们提问内容的纸张。","pronunciation":["설문지"]},{"id":"89233692031a62c6","term":"한","zh":"一个","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3","entryId":"73278","definition":"多个中的一个。","pronunciation":["한"]},{"id":"2dfdb434387c361c","term":"장","zh":"张，枚，纸","audio":"/audio/2dfdb434387c361c95cd.mp3","entryId":"29607","definition":"计算纸张、照片等薄而宽的东西的数量单位。","pronunciation":["장"]},{"id":"e5721a077be2e027","term":"쓰다","zh":"写，填写","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3","entryId":"65172","definition":"编制申请书或合同等具有一定格式的文件。","pronunciation":["쓰다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/68836bf6c15f88c7112f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n63247-1-8-2","ko":"죄송하지만 지금 갈 길이 좀 바빠서요.","zh":"抱歉，我现在正急着赶路。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"죄송하지만","meaning":"抱歉，愧疚","explanation":"죄송하다：抱歉，愧疚；지만：表示转折或让步：“但是、虽然”。","readings":[{"term":"죄송하다","audio":"/audio/656cf6c32585f66d3b21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91763","senseId":"1","lemma":"죄송하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"죄송하지만","audio":"/audio/8f5e03e932bf717d558b.mp3"}},{"text":"지금","meaning":"现在","explanation":"지금：现在。","readings":[{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62522","senseId":"1","lemma":"지금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}},{"text":"갈","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"14","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갈","audio":"/audio/eb4ba4907fe859283419.mp3"}},{"text":"길이","meaning":"路，道，道路","explanation":"길：路，道，道路；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"길","audio":"/audio/d72c8434585436678000.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59251","senseId":"1","lemma":"길","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"길이","audio":"/audio/75aba55303fbffdfc7bf.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下。","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"바빠서요.","meaning":"忙，忙碌，紧张","explanation":"바쁘다：忙，忙碌，紧张；어서요：用礼貌语气补充理由：“因为……”。","readings":[{"term":"바쁘다","audio":"/audio/23457023f6034aaf6759.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66248","senseId":"1","lemma":"바쁘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바빠서요","audio":"/audio/b25912b8a7d896b4a2d8.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"656cf6c32585f66d","term":"죄송하다","zh":"抱歉，愧疚","audio":"/audio/656cf6c32585f66d3b21.mp3","entryId":"91763","definition":"好像犯了错一样感觉十分过意不去。","pronunciation":["죄ː송하다","줴ː송하다"]},{"id":"df159f47a890ff65","term":"지금","zh":"现在","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3","entryId":"62522","definition":"指正在说话的此时。","pronunciation":["지금"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为做某事而向别的地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"d72c843458543667","term":"길","zh":"路，道，道路","audio":"/audio/d72c8434585436678000.mp3","entryId":"59251","definition":"供人或车等通行的，以一定宽度延伸的长长的地面上空间。","pronunciation":["길"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"23457023f6034aaf","term":"바쁘다","zh":"忙，忙碌，紧张","audio":"/audio/23457023f6034aaf6759.mp3","entryId":"66248","definition":"因为要做的事情多或没有时间而无暇顾及其他。","pronunciation":["바쁘다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ff0298b5bc72464b6ccb.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.167,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=63247","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses